        Year-over-year, revenue <span class="{'highlight-green' if revenue_growth > 0 else 'highlight-red'}">{'grew' if revenue_growth > 0 else 'declined'} {revenue_growth:+.1f}%</span>,
        with <span class="highlight">{discount_utilization:.1f}%</span> of all transactions involving a promotional discount.
        The following sections provide a detailed breakdown by time, product, store, discount strategy, and customer segment.
    </p>
</div>

